      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Padding vs extra: Two kinds of thread that do nothing",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Padding vs extra: Two kinds of thread that do nothing",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "V2N1o90IFzbz31ogtQXSw",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 429.812255859375,
      "y": 139.13810436430848,
      "width": 536.37548828125,
      "height": 31.861895635691514,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a1",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1185593159,
      "version": 286,
      "versionNonce": 438838697,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408457080,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "One square = one thread. One row = one warp (32 threads). The hard cuts each block\ninto rows of 32, top to bottom.",
      "fontSize": 12.744758254276604,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "One square = one thread. One row = one warp (32 threads). The hard cuts each block\ninto rows of 32, top to bottom.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_UEbKpRfMHgj7bpZYicD0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 357.8702392578125,
      "y": 221.5,
      "width": 680.259521484375,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1646513609,
      "version": 235,
      "versionNonce": 1524465705,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408504397,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A. PADDING: block size 48 (not a multiple of 32), n = 144 -> 3 blocks",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A. PADDING: block size 48 (not a multiple of 32), n = 144 -> 3 blocks",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "UHnYG_RDbV-YB0xQnbjV8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 375.2196960449219,
      "y": 246.50000018215422,
      "width": 645.5606079101562,
      "height": 31.86189563569151,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a4",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1337484583,
      "version": 559,
      "versionNonce": 537296617,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408555598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "48 = 32 + 16, so warp 1 of EVERY block has 16 real threads and 16 padded ones: the hardware fills the\nwarp up to 32 with threads that exist only to make the warp whole.",
      "fontSize": 12.744758254276604,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "48 = 32 + 16, so warp 1 of EVERY block has 16 real threads and 16 padded ones: the hardware fills the\nwarp up to 32 with threads that exist only to make the warp whole.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
