    },
    {
      "id": "mQxPcdUaZS88FXtpKef6V",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 385.360595703125,
      "y": 739.776208182154,
      "width": 629.27880859375,
      "height": 79.65473908922877,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1232467047,
      "version": 867,
      "versionNonce": 308242185,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794408959126,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3 blocks x 2 warps = 6 warps for 144 threads of data; 48 of the 192 warp slots are padding (25%).\nPadded threads hold a seat in the thread-seat pool, a register share, and a core in every pass,\nand never do anything. \n\nFix: pick a block size that is a multiple of 32.",
      "fontSize": 12.744758254276604,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3 blocks x 2 warps = 6 warps for 144 threads of data; 48 of the 192 warp slots are padding (25%).\nPadded threads hold a seat in the thread-seat pool, a register share, and a core in every pass,\nand never do anything. \n\nFix: pick a block size that is a multiple of 32.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "az3cK-QmyGktcvy2XrNaH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 299.47021484375,
      "y": 869.276208,
      "width": 789.0595703125,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2V",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 330134375,
      "version": 392,
      "versionNonce": 382185703,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409354583,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "B. EXTRAS: block size 32, n = 100 -> div_ceil(100, 32) = 4 blocks = 128 threads",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "B. EXTRAS: block size 32, n = 100 -> div_ceil(100, 32) = 4 blocks = 128 threads",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "byL5gqr9XK8SMkLlvBsrh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1054.1727686328124,
      "y": 458.913475,
      "width": 522.591552734375,
      "height": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#e9ecef",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2W",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 221893351,
      "version": 348,
      "versionNonce": 688370535,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794409285004,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "If we did block sizes of 32 instead, we would have 5 blocks\nwith 1 warp each, with the last block being half full. The last\nblock would have 16 extras (one straddling warp). The improvement\nis that, instead of having 16 padded threads per block, we\nhave only 16 extras in the last block only.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "If we did block sizes of 32 instead, we would have 5 blocks\nwith 1 warp each, with the last block being half full. The last\nblock would have 16 extras (one straddling warp). The improvement\nis that, instead of having 16 padded threads per block, we\nhave only 16 extras in the last block only.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oRRI-MKNZUpN3brPbS7LD",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 385.8435974121094,
      "y": 905.1530634553856,
      "width": 652.3128051757812,
      "height": 31.86189563569151,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2X",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1928775081,
      "version": 1053,
      "versionNonce": 1869539559,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794409509478,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Threads come in whole blocks, so the launch overshoots the data by 28. Only the LAST block has them;\n`if i < n` switches them off (one path, second pass).",
      "fontSize": 12.744758254276604,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Threads come in whole blocks, so the launch overshoots the data by 28. Only the LAST block has them;\n`if i < n` switches them off (one path, second pass).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
